        "foundation_story": {
          "type": "story_text",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "",
            "title": "Built From a One-Bedroom Condo",
            "text": "<p>In 2018, inside a one-bedroom condo in Hackensack, New Jersey, Jack Turner Watches officially began.</p><p>There were no investors. No big launch campaign. Just a vision.</p><p>To build timepieces that felt earned.</p><p>To create watches that a man could wear through milestones — promotions, weddings, fatherhood, reinvention — and eventually pass on.</p><p>Today, Jack Turner Watches are worn around the world by men who understand something simple:</p><p>A watch is not just a timekeeper.</p><p>It's a statement.</p><p>A symbol of standards.</p><p>A reminder that your time matters and wasting it is not an option.</p>"
          }
        },
